  "releaseNotes": "- Reading a missing file throws FileNotFoundException instead of creating an empty file\n- Paths are kept inside the root directory; names with a colon, Windows device names and names ending in a dot or space are rejected\n- Symbolic links and junctions below the root are refused unless AllowLinks is set\n- Writeable local file streams no longer try to re-upload into their own file on dispose\n- Move creates the target folder\n- Update Cloud.File.Storage.Manager.Common 3.0.0 -> 3.1.0",
